        "Content": "Residential Site \r\nAcres, Knockatallon\r\nCo. Monaghan\r\n\r\n*c.2.25 acre holding comprising a residential building site, with Full Planning, with the space and potential for a second site.\r\n* Site A: Full planning for a substantial c.228m2, two story residence. \r\n* Planning Granted May 2026 (Monaghan County Council Reference 25/70)\r\n* Close Proximity to a range of amenities \r\n*Holding is a level roadside land plot, located c.5km to Scotstown Village, c.14km to Monaghan Town and c.2.5km to the Northern Ireland Border, in the infamous scenic landscape of Knockatallon, Co Monaghan.\r\nMay be sold in one or more lots\r\n                        \r\nFor further details, contact Monaghan Property."
